  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Includes excerpts from books meaningful to the book artist. Each excerpt is identified by title and accompanied by a symbol. The symbols correspond to those on the legend card and describe the methods by which the excerpts were found, all of which relate in some way to the number 43.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The text is printed in black, green, and red on 32 leaves of translucent graph paper which fold accordion-style and overlay a second accordion of color maps of the 43rd parallel.  "Legend card" is in a pocket on the upper board, "Annotated bibliography" (32 unnumbered pages) is in a pocket on the lower.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The deluxe edition is issued in a case made with green goatskin leather and lined with brown illustrated paper and includes a compass.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The standard edition is 86 copies, deluxe is 12.</subfield>
  </datafield>
